# Vendored and minified assets. Prettier does not know these are build output and
# happily expands them, turning a handful of minified lines into thousands of
# formatted ones. Formatting them also loses the point of shipping them minified.
public/css
**/*.min.js
**/*.min.css

# Doc and blog prose. `npm run sync:upstream` pulls this content from
# node-red/node-red, so reflowing paragraphs here means every future sync arrives
# as a conflict against our own rewrapping. Frontmatter quote style would churn
# ~190 files for no reader-visible gain. Formatting stays on the code that is
# actually ours: src/components, src/layouts, src/pages, src/lib, src/styles,
# scripts and tests.
src/content/**/*.md
src/content/**/*.mdx

# prettier-plugin-astro cannot parse this file. It has a `<style is:global>`
# nested inside a `{tuning && (<>...</>)}` conditional, and the plugin tries to
# read the CSS custom properties as JS, failing on the first one. A parse error
# fails the whole lint run, unlike a formatting warning, so it has to be excluded
# until the plugin handles style elements inside template expressions.
src/components/WordmarkTuner.astro

# Generated data and audit output, not hand-edited.
**/survey/**
# Audit and migration reports, all generated into a gitignored reports/ dir.
reports/
